              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi abathobekileyo bayokwandisa injabulo yabo kuJehova, futhi abampofu phakathi kwabantu bayojabula ngoNgcwele ka-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
