            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho-ke, ngendlu kaJakobe, uJehova owamhlenga u-Abrahama, uthi: UJakobe akayikujabha manje, nobuso bakhe abuyikuphaphatheka.",
          "type": "text",
