              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lapho ebona abantwana bakhe, umsebenzi wezandla zami, phakathi kwakhe, bayongcwelisa igama lami futhi bangcwelise oNgcwele kaJakobe futhi besabe uNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
